# Swift build artifacts (includes the packaged .app)
# Both variants ignored on purpose: a stray "app/build/" (no dot) showed up
# once after moving the project folder mid-session (probably a leftover
# from a build that failed right after the move, before the module cache
# got cleaned) and nearly got committed via `git add -A` — hundreds of
# .pcm/.swiftmodule files. Never actually tracked, caught before the commit.
app/.build/
app/build/
app/.swiftpm/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local install backups created by install.sh (contain machine-specific paths)
*.backup-*
